keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - perinatal health
  - climate change
  - Brazil
  - RDF
  - OWL
  - semantic web
  - linked data
  - SINASC
  - epidemiology

license: Apache-2.0

abstract: >
  PerinatalKG is a large-scale knowledge graph integrating 27 million
  Brazilian live births (2015-2024) with climate exposure data, neonatal
  mortality records, and municipal socioeconomic indicators. Built using
  RDF/OWL formal ontologies, it provides the first national-scale linked
  dataset for perinatal climate epidemiology in Latin America.
